message: "Якщо ви використовуєте цей пакет, будь ласка, цитуйте статтю нижче."
title: "ASF-UAV-Warning — reproducibility package for agentic multisensor UAV detection"
abstract: >-
  Demonstrative Monte Carlo model of an agentic multisensor system for early
  unmanned aircraft detection and public warning. Synthetic generative model,
  three decision architectures (single radar, static fusion, agentic fusion),
  metrics with bootstrap confidence intervals, and reproducibility tests.
